# Post Install notes

## run as root

update system
```sh
pkg update
```

upgrade system
```sh
pkg upgrade
```

Install required packages
```sh
pkg install sudo fzf htop flock ImageMagick7 dejavu noto-basic noto-emoji i3 i3lock i3status dmenu rofi polybar dunst feh arandr xterm bash git curl wget neovim micro ncdu nnn figlet xf86-video-vesa xorg alacritty lxappearance gtk3 dhcpcd firefox python3 xclip autocutsel starship unzip vscode calcurse py39-i3ipc doas qpwgraph maim pipewire-module-xrdp-0.1 pipewire-spa-oss-g20251117_3 inotify-tools zsh zsh-autosuggestions zsh-completions zsh-fast-syntax-highlighting
```

visudo and uncomment line
```content
# %wheel ALL=(ALL:ALL) ALL
```

add $USER_NAME to correct groups
```sh
pw groupmod wheel -m $USER_NAME
pw groupmod video -m $USER_NAME
```

add to /usr/local/etc/doas.conf
```content
permit nopass :wheel cmd shutdown
permit nopass :wheel cmd reboot
```

add to /boot/loader.conf
```content
kern.vty=vt
```

sysrc wireplumber_enable="YES"
sysrc pipewire_enable="YES"
sysrc dhcpcd_enable="YES"
sysrc dbus_enable="YES"

service dhcpcd start

## Run as user

Download nerd font and unzip in ~/.local/share/fonts
```bash
mkdir -p ~/.local/share/fonts && \
curl -L -o /tmp/JetBrainsMono.zip https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/releases/download/v3.4.0/JetBrainsMono.zip && \
unzip -o /tmp/JetBrainsMono.zip -d ~/.local/share/fonts && \
rm /tmp/JetBrainsMono.zip
```

make ~/.xinitrc with:
ls -la
ls```content
. ~/.profile
exec i3
```

Change shell to bash
```sh
chsh -s /usr/local/bin/zsh
```

Install weather app
```bash
curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/apapamarkou/lazy-weather/main/install | bash
```

copy contents of ./ to /$HOME/ except:
- ./TODO
- ./install
- ./dotfile-paths
- ./.git
- ./doc/
- ./post-install-scripts/

run all scripts in ./post-install-scripts/

confirm and then reboot or just exit

